# Pinned whisper.cpp revision.
#
# whisper.cpp is compiled from source into whisper.xcframework and linked into the app, so
# it is native code we ship. It used to be built from whatever `git ls-remote ... HEAD`
# returned at build time, i.e. an unreviewed, remotely mutable input to every build. It is
# now pinned here and BOTH the Makefile checkout and the CI cache key use this exact sha,
# so a bump is a reviewed commit to this file. This is the revision the last green CI run
# built (run 33488189890).
#
# To bump: review upstream's diff, put the new sha below, let CI rebuild the framework.
eacbd8234c6654cdbf2c377f72b2106875479bdc
